ed_at":"2025-11-14T02:56:30Z"},"body":"Based on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111707 (it can be closed if this PR can be merged)\r\n\r\nI decided to split my big SDL3 joypad features PR ( https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107967 ) into several smaller PRs, this PR is one of them.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds the ability to set the color/brightness of a joypad's LED light color, if it has one. An example of a controller with an LED light is DualShock 4.\r\n\r\nThis PR hasn't been tested yet 😅 but it should work correctly since I copied the code from my earlier PR that had this feature working correctly. ~~After the CI passes, I will test it and create a small test project.~~ (Not sure it's required, this PR is a pretty simple one, it only adds 2 more methods on top of the motion sensors PR)\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] fix encapsulation, see: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111679#discussion_r2432523623","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111681/reactions","total_count":13,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"h